\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 1r-v}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Geert Grote}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Stundenbuch, Marienoffizium}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  (Fragment) 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (Ende der Matutin:) [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  der heren. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 >U<ol sijn die hemele ende die aerde des heerliken ghewoudes dijnre glorien}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , >d<at gloriose choer der apostelen ...\~\endash \~... >I<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 n di, heer, heb ic ghehopet}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , laet mi niet scandeliken confuus staen inder ewicheit. >Versus.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Die gheest, die troester, alleluya}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , hi sel v leren alle dinc, alleluya\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . (1v Anfang der Laudes:) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >Die morghen loue.< >G<od wilt dencken in mijn hulpe, heer tot mi helpen haeste ...\~\endash \~... >D<ie heer heeft gheregniert ende heeft aenghetoghen die scoenheit, hi heeft aenghetoghen die machte \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ]
