\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [Salutem ex ini]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 micis nostris et de manu omnium, qui oderunt nos ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Lc 1,71-79, Canticum \lquote Benedictus\rquote  [Canticum Zachariae]). [58v] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >Antiphona.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Beata dei genitrix Maria, uirgo perpetua}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CAO 6162}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus, qui de beate Marie uirginis utero uerbum tuum angelo nunciante}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... >De omnibus sanctis antiphona.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sancti dei omnes intercedere dignemini}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CAO 4726}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ).
