\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Philadelphia, Free Library, E M 5:16}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 86r}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Officium beate Marie virginis per totum Adventum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  (Schluss)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 In utrisque uesperis ad Magnificat et ad Nunc dimittis antiphona.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Magnum hereditatis misterium templum dei factus est uterus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CAO 3677}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >Reliqua omnia ut supra ante aduentum domini notatum est. Sciendum, quia ab octaua Pasche usque ad Ascensionem domini dicitur officium beate Marie uirginis sicut ante aduentum domini. Excepto quod ad Benedictus, ad Magnificat et ad Nunc dimittis dicitur hec antiphona.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Regina celi letare alleluia, quia quem meruisti portare}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CAO 4597}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >Reliqua omnia ut supra habentur in cursu beate Marie uirginis ante aduentum.<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ]
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Text entspricht {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Darmstadt, ULB, Hs 4157, Bl. 81v}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Adventsoffizium auch in dem n\u228 \'e4chstverwandten Stundenbuch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 K\u246 \'f6ln, Kolumba-Museum, Hs. K\u246 \'f6nig, Nr. 20, Bl. 92v-104v}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , im Anschluss an das Marienoffizium. Vgl. Ars vivendi, S. 332. Nhd. \u220 \'dcbersetzung des Adventsoffiziums: ebd., S. 59-61.}

