\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Philadelphia, Free Library, E M 5:16}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 86v}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Gebet zur Trinit\u228 \'e4t}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >De sancta trinitate antiphona.< >L<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ibera nos, salua nos, iustifica nos, o beata trinitas}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CAO 3619}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >Versus.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Benedicamus patrem et filium cum sancto spiritu, laudemus et superexaltemus eum in secula}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CAO 7966}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oremus. >O<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 mnipotens sempiterne deus, qui dedisti nobis famulis tuis in confessione uere fidei eterne trinitatis gloriam agnoscere}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... Qui uiuis et regnas deus per omnia secula seculorum. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ]
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Auch in dem Stundenbuch-Druck Hore beate virginis Marie ad usum Sarum, [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Wolf Hopyl?}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ] Pro Anthonio V\u233 \'e9rard, Paris 1503-05, Bl. 38v-39r. Vgl. Abdruck unter: http://manuscripts.org.uk/chd.dk/inc/perg19.html.}

