\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >De sancta Margareta antiphona.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Erat autem Margareta annorum quindecim}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (nicht in CAO). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >Versus.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Adiuuabit eam deus uultu suo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CAO 1282}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Deus, qui beatam uirginem Margaretam ad celos per martirii palmam uenire fecisti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ]
