\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , Z. 28 - 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Kommentar}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  zu den einzelnen Kom\u246 \'f6dien\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Est }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 [gestrichen:}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1  enim}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 ]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1  autem sciendum, quod hec comedie a locis et personis denominantur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , nam prima dicitur Andria ab Andro insula, secunda dicitur Eunuchus a persona Cherea, qui pro eunucho introductus est in domum meretricis. ... - ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 postulande ab eo ante quod dare uelit. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Secunda comedia scilicet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Eunucus. Secunda comedia dicitur Eunucus, cui premictitur titulus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tertia comedia scilicet dicitur Eutontumerumenos. ... - ... reuertente patre Demiphone et patruo Cremete, sequentia plenissime manifestabunt. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Darunter: Merkvers zu allen Kom\u246 \'f6dien:]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Andria uel Eunucus, Heaton, Adelphis, Ethira / Phormio succedens fabula sexta datur. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (s. u. 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 )
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Teiledition (Beginn und Kommentar zu Andria = 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 -3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ): Adri\u225 \'e1n \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 L\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u243 \'f3\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 pez Miguel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Estudio y edici\u243 \'f3n del comentario de Giacomino da Mantova a Terencio: Andria, 1\endash 300, Thesis, University of the Basque Country, 2017 [Online-Ver\u246 \'f6ffentlichung: http://hdl.handle.net/10810/21269], hier S. 23-27, Z. 1-157. Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung (23 Hss., ohne diese Hs.) vgl. ebd., S. 14f. Vgl. auch Ezio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Franceschini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Il commento di Giaccomino da Mantova al prologo dell\rquote Andria di Terenzio, in: Studi e note di filologia latina e medievale, Mailand 1938, S. 165-172, vgl. IHRT 58565 (In principio).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \par}

