\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dominica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Schluss: \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Ps 25,5-12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : ... Odivi ecclesiam] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 malignantium, et cum impiis non sedebo. ... - ... in ecclesiis benedicam domino.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Matutinalpsalm f\u252 \'fcr Feria II.: Ps 26,1-9}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :] [nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 feria secunda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >D<OMINUS illuminatio mea, et salus mea, quem timebo? ... - ... >N<e auertas faciem tuam a me, ne decli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [nes in ira a servo tuo. ..., bricht ab].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Auf 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  am rechten Blattrand von NH 1 erg\u228 \'e4nzt: Ges\u228 \'e4nge (zu Dominica per annum): Ant. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Indutus est dominus fortitudinem et precinxit se virtu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [te]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C-DB 3327}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Ant. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gloria et honor et benedictio ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C-DB 2944}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) etc., sowie unten zu Feria II: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Feria ii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Inuit. Venite exultemus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , neben der Initiale au\u223 \'dferdem erg\u228 \'e4nzt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Feria secunda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

