\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Am Rand von 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Ps 38,7 erg\u228 \'e4nzt: [Ve]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 rumtamen in imagine pertransit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [hom]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 o, sed et frustra conturbatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

