\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Auf 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  von NH 1 erg\u228 \'e4nzt: am rechten Blattrand Ges\u228 \'e4nge zu Feria IV. per annum, u. a. Ant. [Deus deorum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dominus locutus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C-DB 2168}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Ant. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Immola deo sacrificium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [la]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 udis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C-DB 8091}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Laudes ant. Amplius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [lava] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 me, domine, ab iniustici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [a] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 mea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C-DB 1390}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Miserere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Salutare uultus mei,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [deus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 meus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C-DB 4683}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) etc. }

