\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Feria IV.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Schluss: \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Ps 67,35f.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... magnificentia eius] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et uirtus eius in nubibus. ... - ... et fortitudinem plebi sue. Benedictus deus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Matutinalpsalm f\u252 \'fcr Feria V.: Ps 68,1-16}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >S<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ALVUM, nicht ausgef\u252 \'fchrt] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 me fac, deus, quoniam intrauerunt aque usque ad animam meam. ... - ... >N<on me dimergat tempestas aque, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [neque absorbeat me profundum,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ..., bricht ab].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Auf 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  von NH 1 erg\u228 \'e4nzt: am rechten Blattrand oben Ges\u228 \'e4nge zu Feria IV. per annum, u. a. Ant. [Te] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 decet ymnus deus in S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ion] ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C-DB 5115}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Ant. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Labia mea laud\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [abunt] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 te in vita mea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C-DB 3557}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) etc., am linken Blattrand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 feria quinta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , weiterhin im Leerraum neben der Initiale sowie am rechten Blattrand unten Ges\u228 \'e4nge zu Feria V. per annum: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Feria v.: Inuit. Adoremus dominum, quoniam ipse fecit nos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C-DB 1011}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) etc. bis \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In ewangelio:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Salutem ex inimicis nostris et \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [de]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  manu omnium ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C-DB 4684}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). }

