\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 cap. 3, pars 5-11\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : [Beginn fehlt: ... Apud Aegyptios autem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 alias habuisse litteras sacerdotes, alias uulgus; sacerdotales \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u933 \'d5\u917 \'c5\u929 \'d1\u913 \'c1C \u928 \'d0\u913 \'c1\u925 \'cd\u948 \'e4\u917 \'c5\u924 \'cc\u927 \'cfC\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [lies: \u7985 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8048 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8053 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uulgares. Graecarum litterarum usum primi Fenices inuenerunt. Unde et Lucanus: Fenices primi, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [gestrichen:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  magni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , von j\u252 \'fcngerer Hand interlinear korrigiert:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fame\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  si creditur, ausi mensuram rudibus uocem signare figuris. ... - ... quae et figura crucem significat et in numero decem demonstrat. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 cap. 4, pars 1-15\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >DE LITTERIS LATINIS<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >L<atinas litteras Carmentis nympha prima Italis tradidit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . ... - ... A quibusdam et ordo adicitur, id est quae praecedit, quae sequitur, ut A \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [prior sit, subsequens B. ..., bricht ab.].\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  
