\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Guilelmus Durantis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Pontificale}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 , lib. II, cap. 22f.: Benedictio signi seu campanae / Beneditio muneris, quod in ecclesia offertur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Fragment.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 lib. II, cap. 22:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 De benedictione signi et campanae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Schluss, Nr. 10-13:] [... >Consequenter] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ponuntur in turibulo ignis et thimiama, thus et mir\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [r]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 a, si haberi possunt, et thuribulum sic subponatur signo, ut totum fumum recipiat. Et cantatur hec antiphona<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >D<eus, in sancto uia tuo. Quis deus magnus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 psalmus Viderunt te aque ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >et dicitur quicquid sequitur usque in finem psalmi cum< Gloria patri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >O<remus:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >O<mnipotens dominator Christe, qui secundum assumptionem carnis dormiente in naui, dum aborta tempestas maria conturbasset ... - ... credentium mentes et corpora saluet protectione sempiterna. Per te Ihesu Christe ... >Postea dicitur euangelium secundum Lucam<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >I<ntrauit dominus Ihesus in quoddam castellum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Lc 10,38): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Require in festo Assumptionis. Ultimo producit signum crucis super illud<.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 lib. II, cap. 23\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Beginn:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 De benedictione muneris, quod in ecclesia offertur\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Munus quod in ecclesia offertur hoc modo benedicetur<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >A<diutorium n}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [ostrum]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  i}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [n domine]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , >D<ominus uobiscum, >O<remus: >D<eus, cuius uerbo et potentia facta sunt omnia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , cuius dono percepimus que ad uite remedium possidemus ... fidelium sanctificator accedas. Suscipe de \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [manu famulorum tuorum munus ..., bricht ab].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck: Michel \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Andrieu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Hg.), Le Pontifical Romain au moyen-\u226 \'e2ge, Bd. 3: Le pontifical de Guillaume Durant (Studi e testi 88), Citt\u224 \'e0 del Vaticano 1940, S. 536f.}

